# shadows.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema (docs/m3-status.md, Impeller
# parity), both at DPR 3. Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any
# channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Inside the blurs a level or two; over 32 only at the edges of the rounded
# rect, the oval and the physical models. Rects, rounded rects and circles
# blurred analytically, as Impeller blurs them; the oval as Impeller's
# shadow mesh (emblema#242). Measured 2026-11-01, lavapipe: 5.091% differ,
# 0.002% by more than 32; with the oval blurred through a layer it was
# 6.290%.
differ 6.0
differ_over_32 0.05
